      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>You can find the URL of the internal API server by running the <code>oc get infrastructures.config.openshift.io cluster -o jsonpath='{"{"}.status.etcdDiscoveryDomain{"}"}'</code> command.</p></dd>
